      <title>In the Mouth of Madness - 01 - with Kendrick Smith</title>
      <link>/episodes/18-in-the-mouth-of-madness-01/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/episodes/18-in-the-mouth-of-madness-01/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Join the second &lt;a href=&#34;https://itch.io/jam/this-should-be-a-game-jam-02&#34;&gt;This Should Be a Game! Jam&lt;/a&gt; and make something inspired by &lt;em&gt;In the Mouth of Madness&lt;/em&gt; or &lt;em&gt;The Thing&lt;/em&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;https://player.rss.com/this-should-be-a-game/3110721?theme=dark&amp;v=2&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;202px&#34; title=&#34;In the Mouth of Madness (1994) - 01 - with Kendric&#34; frameBorder=&#34;0&#34; allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#34; allowfullscreen scrolling=&#34;no&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://rss.com/podcasts/this-should-be-a-game/3110721/&#34;&gt;In the Mouth of Madness (1994) - 01 - with Kendric | RSS.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Talking with Kendrick Smith (&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.talesyettold.com/&#34;&gt;talesyettold.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/kendomakesfilms.bsky.social&#34;&gt;@kendomakesfilms&lt;/a&gt;) about how to turn 1994&amp;rsquo;s In the Mouth of Madness into a TTRPG.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Games referenced:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/variations-on-your-body&#34;&gt;Variations On Your Body&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.blinkingbirchgames.com/product/death-of-the-author&#34;&gt;Death of the Author&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://backwards-tabletop.itch.io/spine&#34;&gt;SPINE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://speakthesky.itch.io/like-skyscrapers&#34;&gt;Like Skyscrapers Blotting Out The Sky&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://jaclynlewis.itch.io/highway-haunt&#34;&gt;Highway Haunt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://bannerlessgames.itch.io/void-1680-am&#34;&gt;Void 1680&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://kumada1.itch.io/game-lamprey&#34;&gt;Game Lamprey&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://roswellian.itch.io/kubrick-a-post-adaptation-game&#34;&gt;Kubrick: A Post Adaptation Game&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://hauntedtable.itch.io/triangle-agency&#34;&gt;Triangle Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://store.steampowered.com/app/632470/Disco_Elysium__The_Final_Cut/&#34;&gt;Disco Elysium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/abnormal&#34;&gt;Abnormal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://grahamgentz.itch.io/under-the-autumn-strangely&#34;&gt;Under the Autumn Strangely&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/dream-askew&#34;&gt;Dream Askew/Dream Apart&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/crum/realis&#34;&gt;Realis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.flashlegacy.com/game/pandemic/&#34;&gt;Pandemic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.gauntlet-rpg.com/brindlewood-bay.html&#34;&gt;Brindlewood Bay&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
